@token = {{$dotenv GITHUB_TOKEN}}
### GitHub: limit sa tokenom
GET https://api.github.com/rate_limit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Svi projekti
GET http://localhost:3000/projects

### Jedan projekat
GET http://localhost:3000/projects/euro-elite

### Novi projekat
POST http://localhost:3000/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "portfolio",
  "title": "Portfolio sajt",
  "description": "Moj lični sajt sa projektima.",
  "technologies": ["TypeScript", "React", "Node.js"],
  "githubUrl": "https://github.com/Vasic11/portfolio",
  "featured": true
}

### Neispravan projekat
POST http://localhost:3000/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "slug": "Moj Projekat",
  "titel": "x",
  "description": "kratko",
  "technologies": 5,
  "githubUrl": "nije-link",
  "featured": "da"
}

### Izmena
PATCH http://localhost:3000/projects/qa-testing
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "QA i load testiranje"
}

### Neispravna izmena
PATCH http://localhost:3000/projects/qa-testing
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "githubUrl": "nije-link"
}

### Brisanje
DELETE http://localhost:3000/projects/qa-testing

### Projekat iz organizacije
GET http://localhost:3000/projects/graffito

### Shell projekat
GET http://localhost:3000/projects/shell-data-pipeline


### GitHub: podaci o repou
GET https://api.github.com/repos/Vasic11/euro-elite

### GitHub: jezici
GET https://api.github.com/repos/Vasic11/euro-elite/languages